Files: *
Copyright: Ferrofin contributors
           Jellyfin contributors
           Intro Skipper contributors
           File Transformation contributors
License: GPL-3
Comment: Ferrofin is a Rust port of the Jellyfin media server
 (https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin). It also ports the GPL-3.0
 Jellyfin plugins Intro Skipper
 (https://github.com/intro-skipper/intro-skipper), File Transformation
 (https://github.com/IAmParadox27/jellyfin-plugin-file-transformation),
 TheTVDB (https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-plugin-tvdb) and
 OpenSubtitles (https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-plugin-opensubtitles).
 .
 /usr/bin/ferrofin-server statically links third-party Rust crates and C
 libraries, which keep their own permissive licenses (among them MIT,
 Apache-2.0, BSD and ISC); SQLite is public domain and jemalloc is
 BSD-2-Clause.

Files: crates/ferrofin-api/src/handlers/merge_versions.rs
       crates/ferrofin-extensions/assets/mergeversions/*
       crates/ferrofin-extensions/src/merge_versions.rs
       crates/ferrofin-traits/src/merge_versions.rs
Copyright: 2019 Claus Vium
           Ferrofin contributors
License: GPL-3 and Expat
Comment: The settings page is vendored unchanged from, and the Rust code is
 ported from, the Merge Versions Jellyfin plugin
 (https://github.com/danieladov/jellyfin-plugin-mergeversions), published
 under the Expat (MIT) license.

Files: crates/ferrofin-providers/src/fanart.rs
